#: of pwnlib.rop.ret2dlresolve.Ret2dlresolvePayload:3
msgid "Binary to search"
msgstr "検索対象のバイナリ"

#: of pwnlib.rop.ret2dlresolve.Ret2dlresolvePayload:5
msgid "Function to search for"
msgstr "検索する関数"

#: of pwnlib.rop.ret2dlresolve.Ret2dlresolvePayload:7
msgid "List of arguments to pass to the function"
msgstr "関数に渡す引数のリスト"

#: of pwnlib.rop.ret2dlresolve.Ret2dlresolvePayload:9
msgid "The address where the payload will be written to. If not provided, a suitable address will be chosen automatically (recommended)."
msgstr "ペイロードを書き込むアドレス。指定しない場合は、適切なアドレスが自動で選ばれます（推奨）。"

#: of pwnlib.rop.ret2dlresolve.Ret2dlresolvePayload:13
msgid "The address where the location of the resolved symbol will be written to. If not provided will be equal to data_addr."
msgstr "解決されたシンボルの位置を書き込むアドレス。指定しない場合は data_addr と同じになります。"

